  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "either 是常考单词，常出现在主谓一致的练习中，所以学生一定要知道：either…or…, neither…nor…, not only…but also…, there be 等词语在连接多个主语时，谓语动词用单数还是复数形式取决于离它最近的那个主语。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Either you "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "or he is"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " going. 要么你去，要么他去。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Neither I "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "nor you are"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " wrong. 我和你都没有错。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Not only"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " you "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "but also I was"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " surprised by the news."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "不仅你，连我也对这条消息感到惊讶。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is a pen"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " and some books on the desk. 桌子上有一支笔和几本书。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
